('MILE000017', 'PRJ000011', 'Requirement Gathering', 'This phase focuses on collecting and analyzing detailed requirements for the NRI Services platform. It includes understanding NRI service needs such as investments, property assistance, taxation, and documentation support. Webinar requirements (registration forms, scheduling, reminders, and attendee management) will also be finalized. Stakeholder discussions, workflow definitions, and functional specifications will be documented to ensure clarity before development begins.', '2025-12-08', '2025-12-10', 'Not Started', 0.00, 'Prabakar.D', '2025-12-24 15:42:30', 'Prabakar.D', '2025-12-24 15:58:08'),
('MILE000018', 'PRJ000011', 'Development', 'This phase involves the complete development of the NRI Services platform based on the finalized requirements. Core modules such as webinar registration, admin dashboard, and notifications will be implemented. Backend APIs, database integration, and frontend interfaces will be developed and tested. Security, role-based access, and data validation will be ensured throughout the development process.', '2025-12-11', '2026-01-05', 'Not Started', 0.00, 'Prabakar.D', '2025-12-24 15:57:20', 'Prabakar.D', '2025-12-24 15:58:08'),
