(509, 743, 'USR000008', '2026-06-09', NULL, NULL, 'Visited and Collects Dental Application Requirements', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, 'Exclusive', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', 'No', '2026-06-30', 'Follow-up Needed', NULL, 'Dental Management Software – Complete Requirements\n\nPatient & Treatment Management\n• Patient profile image upload.\n• Treatment image upload and storage.\n• View complete treatment history with images.\n• Maintain digital patient records and documents.\nDoctor Management\n• Doctor profile creation with image upload.\n• Configure doctor specialization and consultation timings.\n• Display doctor availability and schedules.\nDoctor Availability Scheduling\n• Configure doctor-specific working days and timings.\n• Example: Orthodontist (Ortho Doctor) available on Sundays from 9:00 AM to 11:30 AM.\n• Appointment booking should be restricted to configured schedules only.\nSmart Appointment Slot Management\n• Automatic appointment slot generation at 10-minute intervals.\n• Example: 9:00 AM, 9:10 AM, 9:20 AM, etc.\n• Configure morning and afternoon sessions separately.\n• Display only available appointment slots.\nAppointment Validation & Booking Control\n• Booked slots should be automatically hidden from other patients.\n• Prevent duplicate bookings for the same time slot.\n• Real-time slot availability updates.\nToken & Queue Management\n• Automatic token generation based on booking order.\n• Display token number during appointment confirmation.\n• Efficient patient queue management.\nWhatsApp Appointment Notifications\n• Send appointment confirmation to patients via WhatsApp.\n• Include:\nPatient Name\nDoctor Name\nAppointment Date\nAppointment Time\nToken Number\nDoctor WhatsApp Notifications\n• Notify doctors instantly when appointments are booked.\n• Send patient details and appointment schedules to doctor mobile numbers.\nAppointment Dashboard\n• Doctor-wise appointment dashboard.\n• View booked, completed, cancelled, and pending appointments.\n• Real-time appointment status tracking.\nPatient Record Sharing & Security\n• Securely share patient records, prescriptions, X-rays, and treatment details.\n• Share records through WhatsApp, Email, or PDF.\n• Maintain sharing history and access logs.\n• Ensure patient privacy and secure document access.\nAppointment Capacity Management\n• Configure maximum patient bookings per doctor/session.\n• Once the maximum limit is reached, stop further bookings automatically (or)\n• Display message:\n\"Maximum appointment slots reached. Please contact the clinic for assistance.\"\n• Display clinic contact number for booking support.\n• Prevent overbooking and ensure smooth patient flow.\nReports & Analytics\n• Daily, weekly, and monthly appointment reports.\n• Doctor-wise patient reports.\n• Treatment and revenue reports.\n• Patient visit history reports.\n• Appointment performance analytics.', NULL, 0, NULL, '2026-06-09 19:49:15', NULL, '2026-06-25 13:14:32'),
