(1183, 1192, 'USR000017', '2026-07-14', NULL, NULL, 'HMS', NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, 'Exclusive', 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', 'No', NULL, 'Follow-up Needed', NULL, 'I waited for a long time to meet Ms. Doctor, but she was busy attending to outpatients. Ms. Doctor had asked the receptionist to tell me to wait. However, the receptionist did not communicate this properly. Even when I requested to step out and return later, they asked me to continue waiting, assuring me that I would be able to meet the doctor. In the end, I couldn\'t meet either Ms. Doctor or Mr. Doctor. After an argument, I gave another visiting card to the receptionist. They apologized and said they would call me when the doctor is available and the doctor available time is 9:30 to 3: 30', NULL, 0, 'USR000017', '2026-07-14 16:34:45', 'USR000017', '2026-07-15 10:05:58'),
