('UPD000639', 'TSK000366', 'PRJ000034', 'USR000006', '2026-05-07', 'Completed', 'Today, I completed the Wishlist module and implemented the Product checkout flow.\r\nUsers can now save products to their wishlist and proceed with a smooth checkout process.', 9.00, NULL, 'Nithish  kumar', '2026-05-07 18:20:45'),
